WEBVTT

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.980
<i>GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:23.590
Backbeard-sama made his choice then.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:25.240
Agnes!

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.340
I'm sorry.

00:00:27.700 --> 00:00:29.490
Go back West!

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.160
Go home!

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:38.290
<i>The world you see isn't all there is.</i>

00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:41.260
<i>There are things you can't see.</i>

00:00:41.630 --> 00:00:44.970
<i>See? In the darkness behind you...</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:01.190 --> 00:01:04.860
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>Slumbering in bed in the morning</i>

00:01:05.200 --> 00:01:08.780
<i>asa wa nedoko de gu gu gu</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:09.620 --> 00:01:13.500
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>Ghosts don't have school</i>

00:01:13.620 --> 00:01:17.290
<i>obakenya gakkou mo</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>Or tests or anything</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:21.170
<i>shiken mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:21.750 --> 00:01:25.970
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:26.090 --> 00:01:29.550
<i>minna de utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:29.890 --> 00:01:33.770
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>Sports festivals in the graveyard at night</i>

00:01:34.180 --> 00:01:37.640
<i>yoru wa hakaba de undoukai</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>It's so fun, it's so fun</i>

00:01:38.520 --> 00:01:42.520
<i>tanoshiina tanoshiina</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>Ghosts don't die</i>

00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:46.650
<i>obake wa shinanai</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>Or get sick or anything</i>

00:01:46.780 --> 00:01:50.070
<i>byouki mo nannimo nai</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>Ge, ge, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:50.950 --> 00:01:54.540
<i>ge ge gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:54.910 --> 00:01:58.870
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:01:59.000 --> 00:02:02.840
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>Let's all sing together, gegege no ge</i>

00:02:03.340 --> 00:02:07.800
<i>minnade utaou gegege no ge</i>

00:02:14.520 --> 00:02:16.480
Answer me this...

00:02:17.940 --> 00:02:20.350
Why did you say I was your friend?

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.250
I don't have a reason.

00:02:27.610 --> 00:02:28.860
Thank you.

00:02:30.280 --> 00:02:32.930
And, goodbye...

00:02:32.930 --> 00:02:34.050
Kitaro...

00:02:35.560 --> 00:02:37.220
Agnes!

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:45.900
<i>Agnes</i>

00:02:45.900 --> 00:02:48.910
<i>Sad child of magic</i>

00:02:48.910 --> 00:02:52.450
<i>Lost in magic, your path unknown</i>

00:02:52.930 --> 00:02:56.710
<i>When walking an unknown path</i>

00:02:56.710 --> 00:03:01.230
<i>Being alone is sad and lonely</i>

00:03:01.810 --> 00:03:04.960
<i>Take someone with you
Drag them into the darkness</i>

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:09.220
<i>Before you lies nothing but darkness</i>

00:03:09.220 --> 00:03:14.280
<i>A darkness that all peer into</i>

00:03:14.720 --> 00:03:15.780
CHAPTER 35

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:20.730
THE WITCHES OF DESTINY

00:03:24.080 --> 00:03:26.210
Here you are.

00:03:27.300 --> 00:03:29.700
I thought you might be here.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:34.110
I got a message from Cat-san.
Everyone's looking for you.

00:03:37.310 --> 00:03:40.480
Remember when we got soaked here?

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.470
Before...

00:03:54.780 --> 00:03:57.050
you asked about my family.

00:03:57.870 --> 00:03:59.730
Oh. Yeah.

00:03:59.730 --> 00:04:05.080
I once went picking flowers
with my mother and Adele.

00:04:13.130 --> 00:04:14.580
It's finished!

00:04:14.580 --> 00:04:17.140
Adele, you wove that wonderfully.

00:04:17.850 --> 00:04:20.210
You can have this, Mother.

00:04:20.210 --> 00:04:21.310
Oh my.

00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:25.600
Thank you.

00:04:29.710 --> 00:04:30.590
Well?

00:04:30.590 --> 00:04:32.150
It's very pretty.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.340
Darn it!

00:04:37.300 --> 00:04:39.270
<i>Koai gamiki!</i>

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.180
Agnes!

00:04:50.550 --> 00:04:52.800
<i>Gamiki koai noe!</i>

00:05:06.940 --> 00:05:08.500
I'm sorry.

00:05:11.690 --> 00:05:13.760
Listen, Agnes.

00:05:13.760 --> 00:05:20.080
You've barely learned magic,
so you shouldn't casually cast spells.

00:05:20.490 --> 00:05:21.540
Okay.

00:05:33.710 --> 00:05:35.510
Backbeard-sama.

00:05:39.070 --> 00:05:43.270
Were you the one who just used magic?

00:05:52.920 --> 00:05:56.610
Backbeard-sama made his choice then.

00:05:56.610 --> 00:05:59.800
Not me, but Agnes.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:02.200
To be the core of the Brigadoon.

00:06:09.810 --> 00:06:12.940
My sister Adele could do anything.

00:06:13.340 --> 00:06:17.360
She memorized a lot more spells than me,

00:06:17.360 --> 00:06:19.160
and was good with a gun.

00:06:19.160 --> 00:06:21.410
She could do anything.

00:06:21.410 --> 00:06:24.910
Compared to her, I'm a failure.

00:06:24.910 --> 00:06:29.330
Personally, I've always wanted
an older sister.

00:06:30.190 --> 00:06:32.670
It's hard having a capable elder sibling.

00:06:40.490 --> 00:06:44.310
We used to do everything together
as children.

00:06:44.310 --> 00:06:48.160
We laughed and cried together. And yet...

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:50.580
When was it...

00:06:51.790 --> 00:06:53.380
When was it...

00:06:54.040 --> 00:06:57.170
that we stopped talking to each other.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:02.550
Perhaps...

00:07:03.470 --> 00:07:08.480
Perhaps I was jealous of
my sister's potential.

00:07:16.020 --> 00:07:17.630
Backbeard-sama.

00:07:17.630 --> 00:07:20.430
You understand, don't you, Adele?

00:07:20.430 --> 00:07:24.110
I have gone to confirm for myself.

00:07:24.110 --> 00:07:30.100
Agnes' magic is powerful enough
to activate the Brigadoon Project.

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:31.480
I understand.

00:07:32.000 --> 00:07:34.730
Carmilla and the others are ready,

00:07:35.130 --> 00:07:38.210
and await the order to
move out at any time.

00:07:38.610 --> 00:07:42.450
All that remains is to
wait for the ring to appear.

00:07:42.450 --> 00:07:43.370
Yes.

00:07:43.370 --> 00:07:48.370
Get me the ring and make Agnes the core.

00:07:48.770 --> 00:07:51.630
By the honor of the witch clan.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:57.360
This will make Japan
part of my Backbeard Empire.

00:08:02.110 --> 00:08:04.470
A reading stronger than ever before!

00:08:04.470 --> 00:08:08.970
Soon! Soon the ring will appear!

00:08:09.580 --> 00:08:12.560
Tell me, what's this ring you're after?

00:08:13.810 --> 00:08:19.940
Back in Sakaiminato,
you mentioned a ring and ran off suddenly.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.490
Kitaro's searching too.

00:08:23.840 --> 00:08:27.140
But he said it's not human business
and won't tell me.

00:08:41.990 --> 00:08:43.630
The Ring of Arcana.

00:08:44.800 --> 00:08:48.490
The Ring of Arcana?
That's what you're looking for?

00:08:50.540 --> 00:08:52.640
The Brigadoon Project.

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:57.000
Mana, listen to me carefully.

00:08:57.750 --> 00:08:59.960
The Brigadoon is...

00:09:00.590 --> 00:09:04.360
a project to turn
large groups of humans into <i>yokai</i>.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.490
What? What do you mean?

00:09:08.490 --> 00:09:10.830
That's not possible is it?

00:09:10.830 --> 00:09:13.170
You can't make humans into <i>yokai</i>...

00:09:13.170 --> 00:09:15.660
It makes it possible!

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:21.440
And Backbeard plans to
carry out the Brigadoon in Japan.

00:09:22.230 --> 00:09:29.030
To turn humans into <i>yokai</i> slaves
and build up the Backbeard Empire.

00:09:29.350 --> 00:09:32.240
Huh? What is that?

00:09:32.580 --> 00:09:37.210
Humans become <i>yokai</i> and then slaves...?

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:42.550
What does the ring have to do with that?

00:09:43.510 --> 00:09:46.860
The key to the Brigadoon is
the Ring of Arcana...

00:09:47.220 --> 00:09:49.600
and a witch's life.

00:09:55.060 --> 00:09:56.350
Agnes.

00:09:57.500 --> 00:10:01.000
This is the law of witches
and our destiny.

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.130
It cannot be escaped.

00:10:05.420 --> 00:10:07.800
That makes no sense...
That makes no sense!

00:10:07.800 --> 00:10:09.010
Enough.

00:10:09.870 --> 00:10:10.890
Go.

00:10:10.890 --> 00:10:13.510
And sacrifice your life.

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:17.790
Mother!

00:10:24.530 --> 00:10:26.220
Mother...!

00:10:26.590 --> 00:10:28.530
Mother has made her decision.

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:33.330
Mother...

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.150
Mother!

00:11:06.730 --> 00:11:09.780
See the Brigadoon.

00:11:09.780 --> 00:11:13.740
The lowly humans have all become <i>yokai</i>.

00:11:14.640 --> 00:11:20.250
Now this land is part of my territory.
Part of the Backbeard Empire!

00:11:34.140 --> 00:11:36.850
Every time it takes a witch's life,

00:11:36.850 --> 00:11:39.370
the ring grows stronger.

00:11:41.500 --> 00:11:42.900
Mother.

00:11:42.900 --> 00:11:45.040
I have it now.

00:11:48.460 --> 00:11:49.800
Mother.

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:55.120
I wish to be a proud witch
like you were.

00:11:55.680 --> 00:11:57.430
And for that...

00:11:59.810 --> 00:12:02.120
<i>YOKAI</i> RALLY

00:12:02.940 --> 00:12:06.630
FIGHT WITH BACKBEARD!

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:05.560
-<i>"Oh no..."</i>
-<i>"I'll turn this into money."</i>

00:12:05.690 --> 00:12:06.570
<i>"Smack!"</i>

00:12:07.610 --> 00:12:12.380
Adele wants to make me the core of
the Brigadoon.

00:12:12.990 --> 00:12:14.870
Like Mother was.

00:12:16.350 --> 00:12:18.140
Hold on.

00:12:18.140 --> 00:12:21.500
Adele is your real sister, right, Agnes?

00:12:23.460 --> 00:12:26.980
Yet she'll sacrifice her own sister? Why?!

00:12:26.980 --> 00:12:30.230
For the honor of our witch clan...

00:12:31.510 --> 00:12:33.030
What is that?

00:12:33.030 --> 00:12:34.700
That's crazy!

00:12:35.050 --> 00:12:38.560
Is that more important than
her own sister's life?!

00:12:40.140 --> 00:12:43.000
That's who Adele is.

00:12:43.770 --> 00:12:47.860
For her, witch clan honor is
the most important thing.

00:12:48.570 --> 00:12:50.500
I'm getting out of here!

00:12:51.490 --> 00:12:54.220
You won't listen to
your best friend's warning?

00:12:54.220 --> 00:12:55.350
Screw you then!

00:12:55.350 --> 00:12:57.410
Better to live than die.

00:12:57.800 --> 00:13:01.080
I'll run to the ends of the Earth
if I have to!

00:13:03.180 --> 00:13:08.780
What could it mean that Agnes
will be made the core of the Brigadoon?

00:13:08.780 --> 00:13:13.070
It seems the Brigadoon Project
requires the Ring of Arcana

00:13:13.070 --> 00:13:16.720
as well as the life of a witch itself.

00:13:21.520 --> 00:13:24.630
Can't you make up with your sister?

00:13:24.630 --> 00:13:26.290
That's impossible.

00:13:26.290 --> 00:13:30.570
She stood by while Mother died.

00:13:31.730 --> 00:13:34.890
Agnes, why can't you see?

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:38.260
Mother's way is what a witch strives for.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.560
The honor of a witch's clan.

00:13:40.560 --> 00:13:45.460
To sacrifice our lives to Backbeard-sama
is our purpose.

00:13:46.160 --> 00:13:51.070
All Adele talks about is
the honor of a witch's clan.

00:13:51.070 --> 00:13:52.820
But what is that?

00:13:52.820 --> 00:13:55.940
Is it worth
sacrificing your life to Backbeard?

00:13:56.260 --> 00:13:58.410
Open your eyes, Agnes.

00:13:58.720 --> 00:14:01.160
Open your eyes, Adele.

00:14:01.720 --> 00:14:03.180
Agnes...

00:14:03.700 --> 00:14:05.960
This is for you.

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:08.940
To protect the honor of our witch clan.

00:14:09.440 --> 00:14:11.790
Give me the Ring of Arcana.

00:14:12.150 --> 00:14:14.800
Then, everything will be over.

00:14:14.800 --> 00:14:17.320
I can never give it to Adele.

00:14:18.200 --> 00:14:19.550
Don't you see?

00:14:23.290 --> 00:14:24.770
Agnes.

00:14:24.770 --> 00:14:27.290
This is all for you.

00:14:27.790 --> 00:14:30.920
So you can carry out your life.

00:14:31.310 --> 00:14:32.750
Agnes...

00:14:33.210 --> 00:14:34.590
Agnes...!

00:14:37.800 --> 00:14:40.830
I won't ask you to understand.

00:14:40.830 --> 00:14:44.330
Even if you say no,

00:14:44.720 --> 00:14:46.480
I will do it!

00:14:50.290 --> 00:14:53.610
My cat friends said around here...

00:14:56.530 --> 00:14:58.340
Agnes, go to Kita--

00:14:58.340 --> 00:15:04.680
At first, I thought I should just use
the Japanese <i>yokai</i>.

00:15:05.040 --> 00:15:08.180
But, after I met Kitaro and his friends,

00:15:08.660 --> 00:15:10.620
and I met you, Mana...

00:15:11.710 --> 00:15:14.250
I wish I'd never
become friends with any of you.

00:15:14.800 --> 00:15:17.610
I should have just used you all.

00:15:17.610 --> 00:15:18.840
That way,

00:15:19.450 --> 00:15:23.700
I wouldn't have to feel guilty for
dragging you all into this.

00:15:27.140 --> 00:15:31.460
I'm glad I could be your friend, Agnes.

00:15:32.940 --> 00:15:34.920
You're my friend, Agnes.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:38.430
I don't consider myself dragged into this.

00:15:38.430 --> 00:15:41.490
I'm sure Kitaro feels the same way.

00:15:43.240 --> 00:15:44.530
Mana!

00:15:48.410 --> 00:15:50.730
You have to talk to Kitaro.

00:15:52.080 --> 00:15:55.820
I'm sorry, but I'm no use here.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.200
It has to be Kitaro and Cat-san.

00:15:58.200 --> 00:16:02.660
But, if Kitaro gets hurt because of me...

00:16:02.660 --> 00:16:04.200
Don't worry!

00:16:04.200 --> 00:16:08.970
Kitaro's much, much stronger
than you think, Agnes!

00:16:10.480 --> 00:16:11.670
Really?

00:16:11.670 --> 00:16:14.670
Yeah! I guarantee it!

00:16:18.190 --> 00:16:21.420
I'll believe you if you say so.

00:16:28.240 --> 00:16:30.560
I'm sure Kitaro will understand.

00:16:30.560 --> 00:16:31.730
Okay.

00:16:31.730 --> 00:16:32.960
Mana.

00:16:36.170 --> 00:16:37.540
Thank you.

00:16:45.610 --> 00:16:47.100
The rain...

00:16:54.710 --> 00:16:56.300
It's Agnes.

00:16:56.300 --> 00:16:57.540
It's the witch.

00:16:57.860 --> 00:16:58.800
It's the witch.

00:16:58.800 --> 00:17:00.050
It's Agnes.

00:17:01.070 --> 00:17:02.630
Get out of here!

00:17:03.110 --> 00:17:04.570
It's her fault!

00:17:04.840 --> 00:17:06.050
Get out!

00:17:06.050 --> 00:17:07.680
It's the witch's fault.

00:17:07.680 --> 00:17:08.680
Go home!

00:17:11.200 --> 00:17:12.520
Go home!

00:17:12.520 --> 00:17:13.770
Get out of here!

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:15.770
Go back West!

00:17:15.770 --> 00:17:16.960
Go home!

00:17:20.550 --> 00:17:21.450
Get out!

00:17:21.450 --> 00:17:23.130
Go home, witch!

00:17:27.050 --> 00:17:28.160
Get out of here!

00:17:28.160 --> 00:17:29.410
This is your fault!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:38.420
Rely on someone when you can.

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:46.260
Hey, what do we do?

00:18:40.790 --> 00:18:42.000
Kitaro.

00:18:48.800 --> 00:18:50.450
Help me!

00:18:54.450 --> 00:18:55.930
All right.

00:18:59.650 --> 00:19:02.020
I'm sorry, Kitaro...

00:19:02.020 --> 00:19:05.530
This is going to cause trouble
for all of you.

00:19:11.070 --> 00:19:12.720
-Kitaro!
-It's Kitaro!

00:19:12.720 --> 00:19:13.970
Kitaro.

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.120
Get Agnes out of here!

00:19:16.770 --> 00:19:19.100
-This is all because of her!
-Kick her out!

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:20.870
She should leave!

00:19:21.580 --> 00:19:23.270
Get out, witch!

00:19:23.670 --> 00:19:26.780
Everyone, did you forget
what happened to Miminaga?

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:29.450
Get out!

00:19:29.450 --> 00:19:33.910
If we drive Agnes from
the GeGeGe Forest... from Japan...

00:19:33.910 --> 00:19:38.020
the tragedy of Miminaga will only
repeat somewhere else!

00:19:39.000 --> 00:19:43.750
But Backbeard wants to make
a country of <i>yokai</i>, right?!

00:19:43.750 --> 00:19:46.340
That's not so bad!

00:19:46.340 --> 00:19:47.480
That's right!

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:53.050
You're right.
He intends to make a country of <i>yokai</i>.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.810
But it will be Backbeard's empire.

00:19:58.810 --> 00:20:03.150
An empire by Backbeard for Backbeard.

00:20:03.150 --> 00:20:10.010
Anyone who doesn't fit, who disobeys, who
resists, will be eliminated immediately.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:13.830
Everyone will live in fear of Backbeard.

00:20:13.830 --> 00:20:17.330
They'll spy on each other,
looking for traitors.

00:20:17.330 --> 00:20:20.330
Is such an empire a good country?

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.360
I refuse!

00:20:31.630 --> 00:20:35.010
A country where
only one being's views are absolute...

00:20:35.010 --> 00:20:38.640
ruled by one who doesn't
accept others? Never!

00:20:40.660 --> 00:20:44.540
I'll fight Backbeard alone if I have to!

00:20:52.420 --> 00:20:53.400
Kitaro!

00:20:54.150 --> 00:20:55.160
Look!

00:20:55.160 --> 00:20:57.660
It's here, it's here, it's here!

00:20:57.660 --> 00:21:01.140
The ring, the ring! The ring's appearing!

00:21:03.660 --> 00:21:05.960
We're going to Japan.

00:21:07.310 --> 00:21:09.630
Go, Adele.

00:21:09.630 --> 00:21:13.550
Bring me the Ring of Arcana.

00:21:13.550 --> 00:21:16.310
Where? Where is the ring?!

00:21:16.310 --> 00:21:18.800
Right here! In Chofu!

00:21:29.630 --> 00:21:33.760
<i>Nanashi is nameless</i>

00:21:34.220 --> 00:21:36.930
<i>One without a name</i>

00:21:37.300 --> 00:21:42.770
<i>Those with names cling to their names</i>

00:21:42.890 --> 00:21:48.860
<i>They cling and cling and die</i>

00:21:48.980 --> 00:21:52.730
<i>Lost lives smell of blood</i>

00:21:52.860 --> 00:21:58.660
<i>A smile appears in a hell of blood pools</i>

00:21:58.780 --> 00:22:04.830
<i>A smile that mocks those with names</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:06.620 --> 00:22:10.500
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>"Hello" in the mountains</i>

00:22:12.050 --> 00:22:14.340
<i>yama de yahho</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>If you call</i>

00:22:14.460 --> 00:22:17.260
<i>hitokoe yobeba</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>An identical "Hello"</i>

00:22:17.380 --> 00:22:19.550
<i>onaji yahho</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>The Yobuko calls back</i>

00:22:19.680 --> 00:22:24.850
<i>yobuko ga kaesu</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>A tree spirit living in the mountains</i>

00:22:25.180 --> 00:22:27.440
<i>yama ni sunderu ki no seirei</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>A used rag</i>

00:22:30.650 --> 00:22:32.860
<i>tsukatta zoukin</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>If you don't keep it clean</i>

00:22:32.980 --> 00:22:35.740
<i>kirei ni shinaito</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>It'll get smelly</i>

00:22:35.990 --> 00:22:38.110
<i>kusaku nattayo</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>The Shiro-Uneri
Will tangle itself around you</i>

00:22:38.240 --> 00:22:43.490
<i>shirouneri karamitsuku</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>Stuck to your face
How horrible</i>

00:22:43.790 --> 00:22:46.040
<i>kao ni bettori korya tamaran</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>See how many ghosts there are</i>

00:22:46.160 --> 00:22:51.540
<i>konnani oruyo obaketachi</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:51.670 --> 00:22:54.090
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>You can't see them
But they're there</i>

00:22:54.210 --> 00:22:59.010
<i>mien keredomo orundayo</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>They're near you</i>

00:22:59.760 --> 00:23:03.430
<i>kimi no chikaku ni</i>

00:23:06.350 --> 00:23:08.730
<i>Sinister </i>yokai<i> activity rises</i>
<i>into the sky.</i>

00:23:08.850 --> 00:23:11.690
<i>Dad, that pillar of light is...?!</i>

00:23:12.190 --> 00:23:14.820
<i>Next time on GeGeGe no Kitaro</i>

00:23:14.940 --> 00:23:17.320
<i>"The Transform All Japanese Yokai Project"</i>

00:23:17.440 --> 00:23:20.160
<i>The door to the unseen world opens...</i>
